-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PRIVACY NOTICE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This application runs entirely on your local machine. No media files, metadata,
search queries, face embeddings, or biometric data are transmitted to any
external server or third party. Face recognition data (embeddings, crop
thumbnails, assigned labels) is stored locally in the application data
directory and is used solely to enable the People feature within the app.

You are responsible for ensuring that your use of this software complies with
applicable privacy laws in your jurisdiction, including any obligations that
may arise from processing biometric data or images of other individuals.

